  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_odda",
      "name": {
        "en": "Odda's Badge",
        "zh": "奥达证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_odda",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Odda has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for close-quarters combat and inflicting Physical damage over a wide area.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Earthshaker responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员奥达擅长近距离作战并造成大范围物理伤害\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使撼地者职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_odda",
      "name": {
        "en": "Old Backpack",
        "zh": "旧背包",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_odda",
      "description": {
        "en": "[Engineering Department Custom-Order Application Form]\nRequest: one custom backpack\nName: Odda\nDepartment: Rhodes Island's Kazdel Office\nPosition: Messenger\nReason:\nAt first, I just had to deliver a handful of letters, maybe some small parcels. My backpack was just the right size for that sort of job, but now, things have changed a bit.\nThe first thing is the letters themselves. A lot of my countrymen went back to Kazdel after the war, and even more of them wrote letters to their relatives. The amount I've got to deliver has multiplied several-fold by now.\nThe second thing is the parcels. Kazdel's full of places that need rebuilding and everyone is eager to help, which means a whole lot of workers living in the construction sites. Their families want to send them food, and I'm the one they ask.\nThese sorts of deliveries don't take me far, but food takes space. It's usually dried stuff, pickled mustard, bread, or sometimes even wine. I'm happy to make these deliveries, but I can't carry that much without splitting them into batches, which really eats into my schedule.\nWhich is why I want Engineering to make me a new backpack, so I can serve the people of Kazdel better than ever.\nNotes:\nIf possible, I'd like my old one to be the base for the new version. I've been through a lot with it.\nOh, right, Closure should have the data on my greatsword, so please make it able to carry at least twice that weight.\nDecision:\nApproved.\nClosure's remarks:\nYou've got quite the request, Odda. Well, I won't hold back then!\n[Classified File]\n[Top Secret]\nRequesting a custom-made backpack is the agreed-upon signal with our informant, Odda.\nAs of today, Odda's role as an informant will enter perpetual dormancy, and he will continue working with Rhodes Island solely as a Messenger.\nWe wish him all the best.\n—Ascalon",
        "zh": "《工程部定制申请单》\n申请事由：定制一个新的背包\n姓名：奥达\n部门：罗德岛驻卡兹戴尔办事处\n职务：信使\n具体理由：\n以前，我基本只需要送一些零散的信件，有时候还会送一些小型货物。那时，这个背包的大小正好，但现在，情况发生了一些变化。\n第一是信件本身。战争结束后，回到卡兹戴尔的同胞很多，写信来寻亲的同胞更多，光是要送的信件数量就是过去的好几倍。\n第二是信件之外的货物。卡兹戴尔遍地都是需要修缮的地方，大家又很热情，于是，许多工人干脆选择住在工地。他们的家人关心他们的伙食，所以总拜托我送些食物给他们。\n这样的送货委托路程上虽然不远，但是货物会占据不小的空间，比如干货、特制的榨菜、面包等等，甚至有时候还有酒。我很高兴能帮大家送这些货物，可是，数量太多了，我每天都要分批送好几次，非常耽误时间。\n所以，我想请工程部帮我做一个新的背包，让我能够更好地帮卡兹戴尔的人们送信和送货。\n备注：\n可能的话，希望能够以这个背包为基础进行改装。我和它感情很深。\n对了，可露希尔小姐应该还留有我那把巨剑的数据，以它的两倍重量来设计背包的承重量吧。\n工程部意见：\n同意申请。\n可露希尔意见：\n口气不小嘛，奥达，那我可就不客气了！\n【权限档案】\n【绝密】\n定制背包是线人奥达与我们约好的信号。\n即日起，奥达的线人身份永久进入休眠状态，以单纯的信使身份与罗德岛合作。\n愿他顺遂。\n——阿斯卡纶",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
